 to September came in under 90% of normal in 35 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids went from 186% in May to June down to 37% in November to December. So far in 2026 the middle has March to April at 76% and June to July at 79%. Grid 23008 had its driest year in 1991 at 68%.</p>"}
